# POST /gallery/view
####Lists out all of the faces you have enrolled in a gallery.

You just need to pass in the gallery_name and will receive back the list of subjects that you have enrolled within that gallery.

+ Parameters
    + `gallery_name`: `"gallery_name":"MyGallery"` (string, required) - Defined by you. `gallery_name` is used to identify the gallery.

<!--a class="apiarylink text-success bolder default-spacing" target="_blank" href="https://kairos.docs.apiary.io/#reference/face-recognition/galleryview/post?console=1">Try it in our API sandbox</a-->

