# POST /gallery/remove
####Removes a gallery and all of its subjects.

Pass your gallery_name and it will be removed along with all of its enrolled subjects.

+ Parameters
    + `gallery_name`: `"gallery_name":"MyGallery"` (string, required) - Defined by you. `gallery_name` is used to identify the gallery.

<!--a class="apiarylink text-success bolder default-spacing" target="_blank" href="https://kairos.docs.apiary.io/#reference/face-recognition/galleryremove/post?console=1">Try it in our API sandbox</a-->

+ Request (application/json)
    + Headers

                app_id: 4985f625
                app_key: aa9e5d2ec3b00306b2d9588c3a25d68e

    + Body

            {
                "gallery_name":"MyGallery"
            }


+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body

