# Group Emotion Analysis

### Overview

Analyze and understand emotion, demographics and attention in most videos and images. We look for faces in your footage and pass the facial features and expressions through our face analysis algorithms.
We will return values for the 6 universal emotions, age, gender, and other useful meta data about the faces found.

###Base URL

```
api.kairos.com
```

###Authentication

Requests must be authenticated with your API key. This must be sent as an HTTP header:

```
app_id:  "YOUR APP_ID"
app_key: "YOUR APP_KEY"
```
You can create and manage your API Keys via your [dashboard](https://developer.kairos.com). It's free to sign-up and start testing.

###Requests

Requests return a JSON object with the header:

```
Content-Type: application/json
```

###Usage

It's free to [sign-up and start testing](https://www.kairos.com/signup-emotion).


## GET /v2/analytics/{id}
####Returns the overall impressions from a specific uploaded piece of media.

+ Parameters
    + id: `012345678901234567890123` (string, required) - The id of the media.

