## POST /v2/media{?source}
####Create a new media object to be processed.

+ Parameters
    + source: `http://media.kairos.com/test.flv` (string, required) - The source of the media. URL or file upload.
    + landmarks: `1` (integer, optional) - Set to 1 to receive the feature points, such as eyes, nose, mouth locations, in the JSON response.
        + Default: `0`
    + timeout: `15` (integer, optional) - Set timeout in seconds to wait for the media to be processed. Default timeout is 10 seconds. Max timeout allowed is 60 seconds.
        + Default: `10`

<!--a class="apiarylink text-success bolder" target="_blank" href="https://kairos.docs.apiary.io/#reference/emotion-analysis/v2mediasource/post?console=1">Try it in our API sandbox</a-->

